[{"answer":"Well, Amina, thanks for letting me have your draft in such good time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was just very anxious to hear what you think of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"You can see that I decided to change the topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I had been interested in looking at Barings Factory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I think the hospital was a much better choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact... well... I have to say that I thought it was good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"There's still lots of work to be done...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes... of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But there's plenty of good ideas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It opens well and the first chapter is fine","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but the middle section really stood out for me... most interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That's amazing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"because I really didn't find it a bit easy to write...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How long did you work on the whole thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I spent about two or three weeks reading and doing general research","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I dashed the writing off very quickly...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"so about four weeks in all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's about par for the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"You've got a while yet to make the changes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right... no problem...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Let's have a look at my notes here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Starting with section headings...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"the broad divisions are good but you'll have to re-do the actual headings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've made some suggestions in the margins...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, this information on local housing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see why you put it there","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but it really isn't relevant to the approach you've taken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I see what you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Now... what did I say about the interviews?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I worked very hard on those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I really thought they were valuable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/34.mp3"},{"answer":"They are, Amina, but they're very complex and rather unclear at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/35.mp3"},{"answer":"You're going to have to spend a bit of time making the data a lot clearer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/37.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as I don't have to remove them altogether...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/38.mp3"},{"answer":"No, don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/39.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the chronology...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/40.mp3"},{"answer":"the list of dates?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't sure whether I should rewrite those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/42.mp3"},{"answer":"My advice on that is to take them out. I feel it makes the whole piece appear too simplistic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, if it'll help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, there are a couple of other books I'd like you to look at.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you got a pen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... Approaches to Local History by John Mervis...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And then I think you need to think about ways of representing interview data.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Have a look at Sight and Sound by Kate Oakwell.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Sight and Sound.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you know I'm going away on holiday next week...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So when you've made the changes, I suggest you show the work to your Support Tutor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Support Tutor... right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you do the proof reading...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Proof reading...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/57.mp3"},{"answer":"When by, do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd aim for the 29th of June","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and after that you should get it laser printed...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but be careful because the computer centre closes on 10 July.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And then I hand it in to...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, the Faculty Office as usual.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'm all set now!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/66.mp3"},{"answer":"A pleasure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/67.mp3"},{"answer":"See you when I get back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep. Thanks, Dr Bryson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-3-2023-08-20-18-53-11/71.mp3"}]
